      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY: The Trans-Canada Highway is reduced to one lane of alternating traffic between La Manche Siding and the turn off to Upshall and Little Harbour East. \n\nWhitbourne RCMP and first responders are responding to a motor vehicle collision between a commercial tractor trailer unit and a passenger car.\n\nMotorists are asked to exercise patience and caution, and obey all instructions from police and other responders.\n\nUpdates to follow.\n\n#nltraffic",
